// HCDE mod compatibility resource for DoomCenter (doomcenter_v95.pk3 and later).
//
// This file is HCDE-owned. It is layered on TOP of DoomCenter and is never
// written into the third-party DoomCenter archive.
//
// DoomCenter is a Skulltag/Zandronum-era hub mod. On HCDE (GZDoom-derived) its
// DECORATE references a Skulltag/Zandronum ENGINE built-in actor, FloatyIcon,
// which does not exist in HCDE and is NOT shipped in skulltag_content-4.0.pk3
// or skulltag_actors.pk3 (verified). DoomCenter does:
//
//     ACTOR DCFloatyIcon : FloatyIcon replaces FloatyIcon
//
// so the missing parent/replacee aborts the whole DECORATE parse with a fatal
// "Parent type 'FloatyIcon' not found" (the parent lookup is resolved by load
// order at parse time, which is why this stub must be loaded BEFORE DoomCenter;
// see HCDE_ModCompat's preload handling).
//
// FloatyIcon in Skulltag is a tiny non-interacting floating display actor (the
// chat/medal bubble base). DoomCenter immediately replaces it, so the only
// requirement here is that a valid, inert actor named FloatyIcon exists for the
// subclass to derive from. This is an original HCDE-authored stub, not a copy
// of any third-party actor.
ACTOR FloatyIcon
{
	+NOBLOCKMAP
	+NOGRAVITY
	+NOINTERACTION
	+DONTSPLASH
	+NOTONAUTOMAP
	RenderStyle Translucent
	Alpha 1.0
	States
	{
	Spawn:
		TNT1 A -1
		Stop
	}
}
